        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Nestled in the heart of <strong>Khao Sok National Park</strong>, Cheow Lan Lake is one of the most spectacular natural destinations in southern Thailand. With its emerald waters, towering limestone cliffs, and floating bungalows surrounded by dense jungle, it’s no wonder this lake is often called <em>Thailand’s hidden paradise</em>.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          This guide answers the most common <strong>questions about Cheow Lan Lake</strong> — from how to visit and what to do, to its history, wildlife, and practical travel tips.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is Cheow Lan Lake Worth Visiting?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Absolutely — 100%.<br /> The lake is consistently rated among Thailand’s top natural attractions. Travelers describe it as a highlight of their entire trip, combining adventure, relaxation, and untouched wilderness in one place.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Adventure:</strong> Kayak through limestone karst scenery, trek into the ancient rainforest, spot the wildlife or explore mysterious caves.</span>
          </li>
