            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Relaxation:</strong> Stay overnight in floating bungalows, swim in turquoise waters, and wake up to the sounds of gibbons echoing across the lake.</span>
          </li>
