            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Scenery:</strong> The lake’s serene atmosphere and striking karst formations make it an unforgettable escape from Thailand’s busier beaches and cities.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
