            <span><strong>Hiking:</strong> Trails range from short scenic walks to full-day jungle treks with guides.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Cave Exploration:</strong> Visit <strong>Coral Cave</strong> or <strong>Nam Talu Cave</strong> to see stunning limestone rock formations. Spot cave-dwelling wildlife such as bats, snakes, and spiders,</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>“Little Guilin”:</strong> A photo hotspot named after China’s Guilin, known for its reflection of karsts in still water.</span>
          </li>
