        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>A Brief History of Cheow Lan Lake</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Though it looks ancient, the lake is <strong>artificial</strong>. It was created in 1987 when the <strong>Ratchaprapha Dam</strong> was built by the <strong>Electricity Generating Authority of Thailand (EGAT)</strong> on the Klong Saeng River.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The dam provides:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>554 million kWh of hydroelectric power</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Tourism mainly centered around the floating raft houses / restaurants</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Flood control for the local area</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Fisheries that produce hundreds of tons of fish and shrimps each year</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Irrigation to assist local agriculture</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          It also submerged several villages. Remnants of their temples and forests still rest below the water’s surface, with ghostly tree trunks poking through in places.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Historically, this area was once a route of the <strong>Southern Silk Road</strong>, and later a refuge for <strong>communist rebels</strong> during Thailand’s 1970s insurgency — adding to its cultural intrigue.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Floating Bungalows</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Floating bungalows (or <a href="/khao-sok-floating-bungalows/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors"><strong>raft houses</strong></a>) are a signature feature built directly on the water, the experience is unforgettable and allows travelers to be fully immersed in nature.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Facilities:</strong> Basic to comfortable — from fan-cooled huts with shared bathrooms to more luxurious bungalows with en-suite.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Amenities:</strong> On-site restaurant/bar, kayaks, swimming.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Peaceful evenings, brilliant sunsets, and misty mornings over the still lake.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <em>Tip:</em> For the best experience, stay at least one night and feel the magic.
        </p>
